      "text": "\\begin{aligned}\nt &= n \\tan\\!\\left(\\frac{\\text{fov}}{2}\\right)\n&\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\frac{n}{t} &= \\frac{1}{\\tan(\\text{fov}/2)} = \n\\cot\\!\\left(\\frac{\\text{fov}}{2}\\right) \\\\\nr &= t \\cdot \\text{aspect}\n&\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\frac{n}{r} &= \\frac{1}{\\text{aspect}\\cdot\\tan(\\text{fov}/2)}\n\\end{aligned}",
