        "ariaLabel": "\\begin{bmatrix} m_{11} & m_{12} & m_{13} & m_{14} \\\\[6pt] m_{21} & m_{22} & m_{23} & m_{24} \\\\[6pt] m_{31} & m_{32} & m_{33} & m_{34} \\\\[6pt] m_{41} & m_{42} & m_{43} & m_{44} \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} x \\\\[6pt] y \\\\[6pt] z \\\\[6pt] 1 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} m_{11}x + m_{12}y + m_{13}z + m_{14} \\\\[6pt] m_{21}x + m_{22}y + m_{23}z + m_{24} \\\\[6pt] m_{31}x + m_{32}y + m_{33}z + m_{34} \\\\[6pt] m_{41}x + m_{42}y + m_{43}z + m_{44} \\end{bmatrix}"
